{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Rolling dice has never been this exciting</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Dicefall, not just luck but also strategy determines your fate. Customize your dice individually and think strategically about how to use them most effectively - every challenge becomes a tactical test.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Your Strategy, Your Success</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Unique dice mechanics with endless possibilities</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Deep customization options for every playstyle</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Power Struggles in Dicefall</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The neutral metropolis of Dicefall is a powder keg. Powerful factions vie for control while Faethium magic flows through the city. Navigate the political power struggles and decide who ultimately gains the upper hand.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Classic RPG Feel Meets Innovation</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the atmosphere of classic 2D RPGs with a completely new twist. Every battle becomes a tactical puzzle, every dice roll a moment of pure tension.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Still in Development - Be Part of It!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dicefall is in alpha phase. Join the community and help shape the future of the game. Your opinion matters!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3888300?t=1755849408","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3888300?t=1755849408","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3888300/587095928f35eee79151d01bd583b0aaf75cacd6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755849408","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3888300/587095928f35eee79151d01bd583b0aaf75cacd6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755849408","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Rolling dice has never been this exciting</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Dicefall, not just luck but also strategy determines your fate. Customize your dice individually and think strategically about how to use them most effectively - every challenge becomes a tactical test.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Your Strategy, Your Success</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Unique dice mechanics with endless possibilities</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Deep customization options for every playstyle</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Power Struggles in Dicefall</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The neutral metropolis of Dicefall is a powder keg. Powerful factions vie for control while Faethium magic flows through the city. Navigate the political power struggles and decide who ultimately gains the upper hand.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Classic RPG Feel Meets Innovation</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the atmosphere of classic 2D RPGs with a completely new twist. Every battle becomes a tactical puzzle, every dice roll a moment of pure tension.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Still in Development - Be Part of It!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dicefall is in alpha phase. Join the community and help shape the future of the game. Your opinion matters!</p>","developers":["DropC Gamestudio"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3888300/da7b72ed467902839ded0eddd813c47023357bc5/header.jpg?t=1755849408","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Copyright DropC Gamestudio 2025","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257186754,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257186754/movie480.mp4?t=1755849406","max":"ht